    "summary": "The exact seed0 8k source SHA de70dd34 was bundled as deployment SHA 7a81e5c3 with base SHA 91b0c587. Across 4,096 reachable states, logits were bit-exact and greedy/sampled actions matched 4,096/4,096. Two mock sessions produced eight protocol hands and 29 independently replayed decisions with disjoint token chains. Full suite: 240 passed.",
